              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Sage PrimaFit External Urine Management for the Female Anatomy</span></span></h1>\n<h2>No catheter. No CAUTI.</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">PrimaFit is designed to bend, fit and stay in place. It’s customizable so you can find a comfortable curve to fit your patients.</span></p>\n",
