          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jun 01 2023 20:19:27 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Help manage urinary incontinence with PrimaFit</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The innovative external urine management system for the female anatomy acts as a transition from indwelling catheters to independent continence. It is designed to address the risk factors required to effectively manage urinary incontinence – <b>fit, securement and performance.</b></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Flexible fit</b> contours to anatomy and maintains shape</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Gentle adhesive pad</b> keeps device in place</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Ultra-soft fabric</b> diverts urine away to help keep skin dry</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Long, flexible tubing</b> accommodates a range of body types</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Reorder #5400</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 22 2024 19:15:41 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
